pe": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 21, "type": "SaveAudioMP3", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioMP3"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [16], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [499.09619140625, 183.24264526367188], "pos": [1338.6566162109375, 2734.41162109375], "widgets_values": ["[Speaker_1]: 跟你说过多少次了，出门的时候记得带钥匙，你怎么又忘了？现在进不去门了吧！\n[Speaker_2]: 我不是故意的，早上太着急赶车，一忙就忘了，我也很无奈啊，你别生气行不行？\n\n[Speaker_1]: 我不是生气，是着急啊！你说你每次都这样，万一我不在家，你岂不是要在门口等一下午？\n\n[Speaker_2]: 我知道错了，下次一定记得，你别再念叨了，现在想想办法，怎么才能进门呀？"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#c09430", "widgets_values": ["## 节点\n\n### OmniVoice 长文本 TTS\n\n支持长文本语音合成，带智能分段和可选的语音克隆。`ref_audio` 为可选 —— 不连接时将自动生成声音。\n\n### OmniVoice 语音克隆 TTS\n\n从参考音频中克隆声音。必须提供 `ref_audio`。不支持分段 —— 长文本请使用长文本 TTS。\n\n### OmniVoice 语音设计 TTS\n\n根据文本描述设计合成声音。无需参考音频。\n\n### OmniVoice 多说话人 TTS\n\n使用 `[Speaker_N]:` 标签生成多角色对话。在 ComfyUI >= 0.8.1 中支持动态说话人输入。\n\n### OmniVoice Whisper 加载器\n\n预加载 Whisper ASR，避免每次运行重复下载。连接到任意 TTS 节点的 `whisper_model` 输入。\n\n---\n\n## 生成参数\n\n| 参数                   | 默认值  | 范围      | 描述                       |\n| -------------------- | ---- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| steps                | 32   | 4-64    | 扩散步数。16=更快，32=均衡，64=最佳质量 |\n| guidance_scale       | 2.0  | 0-10    | 无分类器引导。越高=越贴近文本          |\n| t_shift              | 0.1  | 0-1     | 时间步偏移。越小=更强调早期步骤         |\n| speed                | 1.0  | 0.5-2.0 | 语速。>1=更快，<1=更慢           |\n| duration             | 0.0  | 0-60    | 固定输出时长（秒）。会覆盖 speed。0=自动 |\n| position_temperature | 5.0  | 0-20    | 掩码位置随机性。0=贪心，越高=越随机      |\n| class_temperature    | 0.0  | 0-5     | token 采样随机性。0=贪心，越高=越随机  |\n| layer_penalty_factor | 5.0  | 0-20    | 对更深层 codebook 的惩罚        |\n| denoise              | True | —       | 添加去噪 token 以获得更干净的输出     |\n| preprocess_prompt    | True | —       | 清理参考音频（去除静音、添加标点）        |\n| postprocess_output   | True | —       | 去除生成音频中的长静音              |\n| keep_model_loaded    | True | —       | 保持模型加载（运行间隙卸载到 CPU）      |\n\n**仅限长文本 TTS：**\n\n| 参数              | 默认值 | 范围    | 描述                  |\n| --------------- | --- | ----- | ------------------- |\n| words_per_chunk | 100 | 0-500 | 每段词数。0=不分段。在句子边界处分割 |\n\n---\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "-", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [652.5516357421875, 853.042236328125], "pos": [-322.682373046875, 1258.90380859375], "id": 22, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [18], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [385.4545593261719, 105.45454406738281], "pos": [1284.46044921875, 1439.2950439453125], "widgets_values": ["3分钟教会你一个AI工具，不会你来找我！"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 23, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [20], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [444.885009765625, 584.8245239257812], "pos": [1727.818603515625, 1364.5859375], "widgets_values": ["OmniVoice", "", "女，青年，中音调，陕西话", 32, 1, 0, "auto", "auto", "auto", 1495645124, "randomize", 0], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name